{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa5.u10",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa5.u10",
  "version": 1,
  "content_hash": "3b30ded81f5c090ab13afa9dee244cdddb24e19554efcfee5e7f39638800b716",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u10.l01",
      "sha256": "92b26e6fab33d5890ec709d21def96c3d778721d4df62f4ad08cdcc921572229"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u10.l02",
      "sha256": "c5154a2094e40a5aabb3caf75575489246b8588789e6607ecacfb9970bfee9f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u10.l03",
      "sha256": "3934e089da3644d63c42d1c8b2c1e7af1148d6771eb4dc1453c8fe62b114e5c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u10.l04",
      "sha256": "b402377c855af180c34af0ea6926eb4cdfee53f62ff511b9785c91c895a90659"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u10.l05",
      "sha256": "7f66b3d51a354cb39520bb86a003dc5f9ba1c94fce4e07199043930c7ff4ca43"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u10.l06",
      "sha256": "d7f96f1e69974919c5ddfd61ac731945ef565e1714eae8a16b771d84683a4174"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "0429ab289b14418cf3d655074e930c17ed9bb0f5d850cce6b8d76dc882bf7848",
      "text": "menurun",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "05e8665d1f1ed26476b8dae2da4fa208ed104dffda7fa7f2f602205da06c721b",
      "text": "Menurut saya, Singkawang adalah contoh toleransi yang indah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "07cb298068cd3e58c5fea87bdc9f34396005e529735dfb12cd7f43ae9133bb82",
      "text": "Mas, ini draf laporan saya. Saya menyajikan data dulu, lalu pendapat saya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a0d0cfb00b938ec6b28cd029cfac4213ca7af1d9b401acd9c4cdfb3e2455c68",
      "text": "menyimpulkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "10955836b0de9216befbebd5c0c3ed04235f975878155eccb87e9dbe22dd988d",
      "text": "Betul. Topiknya kunjungan wisatawan saat Cap Go Meh.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "12b4e1d98e3cb7ef1da2488e0d3873ef688c16d5fd9d877dd06ebe87d8eb25d6",
      "text": "Apakah ada pertanyaan tentang kenaikan harga ini?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2437a9a5de369c1273934a82cfa0b68458f6dfd48fc6ad141562544c7c84b433",
      "text": "Saran kami adalah menambah papan petunjuk dalam bahasa Inggris.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2486a5777f49116c0b6ba58ab55fbe17663d6c221f4d589986f8d03eb4231166",
      "text": "pertama-tama",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2612d3a92e34784c6001200ab0ccc8da7eb70b46e9e0aa9eb67660627f61b923",
      "text": "Jumlah kunjungan ke Singkawang naik saat Cap Go Meh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "284a08214da3e1c65a3c908e798a458e691edb99474b020a68a1b2068845908d",
      "text": "Kesimpulan yang berimbang. Terima kasih, Mohamed.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "28aa17280781b66109ece8320768e7276dff7bb3b6b4f5ccc563a364a534eac8",
      "text": "Harga cabai meningkat tajam pada bulan Desember.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "28dc0b2afcbd3d97fcdd3633e168b681c3f4d6aaa51db69b773e0bf7a7de485f",
      "text": "Laporan ini menyajikan data tentang keberagaman agama di Singkawang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "29506e77986ce2f19843dc2281bb78a71e570f40fcb8619b2f8c8d363efdd738",
      "text": "jumlah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2add73c5186d81b092ada6c02bbd26ad24da0e006587da864615006b3cf9bcf9",
      "text": "Selanjutnya, saya akan menjelaskan festival Cap Go Meh. Oleh karena itu … hmm, belum ada hasilnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 98,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2d1b995db95e3bd5dadb0bc9f6c81a45e1654849d2bda8ea49176ca7f6691d10",
      "text": "Dengan demikian, kesimpulanmu jelas. Toleransi bukan sekadar kata di sana.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3065e9b7d9c376745ea767ea99218edde4c67000b7f88f4e35eb3d4904e809d0",
      "text": "rata-rata",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "325d7f163fc4c0fb7ae381b2bcbb43faabead261a8e1267aa6bd56f823e52946",
      "text": "Hadirin yang saya hormati, terima kasih atas perhatian Anda semua.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "337ed9ba1d9054e705057c37c7601f4cce501f9939d0b6bba003d108ba131e56",
      "text": "penurunan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3684ba30d76cbefed97fe0396d7cc5a9d8679b015968248f0f40e0b87de6db53",
      "text": "Menurun lagi. Rata-rata hanya separuhnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3c70c91c58be422a04c8a6890d5843933ab748fbe15bea42c3ed13b3d478000a",
      "text": "Bagaimana dengan penurunan setelah festival?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3caa5756c4b314afa63f11110f07613308f9ce914c8221eeee2e692e4feeae5f",
      "text": "pertanyaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3eed9f491e01c1e7c7d8f2edbc4401f5770a2064692979f0f6de1bf97f694156",
      "text": "Penjualan kue keranjang menurun sedikit setelah Imlek.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "433d0a00cd03f6babfcfc47c8b9bde5af6fea7c8b2da52fc7d48f5ac1fe45aab",
      "text": "Hadirin yang saya hormati, pertama-tama saya akan membahas sejarah Singkawang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "43e3ed1caf90d8250e4db42d203b8d0a1b5f7d37692c84b7ba89c39f3024982b",
      "text": "Hadirin yang saya hormati, saya menyimpulkan bahwa toleransi adalah kekuatan Singkawang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 88,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4716019a211c204601669340845d15f61b96d1a13121c86e1d0fce6886a24923",
      "text": "kenaikan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4f293d48213f494f845bc36302da69594d25f76a3b9ac57112949c4cdb6e74ce",
      "text": "Keberagaman di Singkawang membuat warganya hidup rukun.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "506eab801f9e372ddb4cf2c15445299b1736396611729c8e55338bce81fd6e71",
      "text": "Rata-rata, setiap keluarga punya dua sepeda motor.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "67e3fd5fc7c5fd3c6a9c56c202e7478610d3fa950446d2b8dee0d585727bc615",
      "text": "Pertama-tama, saya akan membahas sejarah Singkawang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6933109b4f78582eedc10d66d1005f0b8959ff63f7dea7578c75dee041db323c",
      "text": "Kami menyajikan data dari tiga kelurahan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6b3c9277608ef741dfdd4b69bfc32c06418cd4a6144c7d05ab7815a08c40939f",
      "text": "Pertanyaan yang bagus, Bu. Tampaknya pedagang perlu acara lain di luar musim festival.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 86,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6d31e6cacc8ab42ab49d2b1d82efeb7f531fba56716fcc07891095c162844b8e",
      "text": "Terima kasih. Apakah ada pertanyaan dari hadirin?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "70a4d14f2666eb734a56a00fe90588115036c0933b649c36954741d506c9ed82",
      "text": "Datamu jelas. Tampaknya festival sangat penting bagi pedagang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "717f84345bf15543d66d77d9c16cf1ed4cccd7d58908e99c96d7a9df09fb029d",
      "text": "Saya menyimpulkan bahwa penurunan harga terjadi setelah musim hujan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "718306369cd6e9920ae3375eb2a1770d302801640d8c45311d32f341b87fb8a1",
      "text": "meningkat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7861c38327331b3ed2527f5d097d85148207e29c03f172ba748e5f350642edc0",
      "text": "Laporan ini membahas kunjungan wisatawan ke Singkawang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7d717cdcabf0f19c7fea57de31ab3435172c6e1b562e6ca33250861e239f4b92",
      "text": "Menarik! Saya akan bertanya kepada wisatawan dan pedagang di sana.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7e29ca1cb62c59b34d9cfb1f47be0dbd1e8e89cbd9ba6dbc14ffb5e630053e93",
      "text": "Oleh karena itu, saya menyimpulkan bahwa Cap Go Meh membantu ekonomi Singkawang. Apakah ada pertanyaan?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 103,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "86271dd1d6974b0eb9d86747803642f5b95580cce7183f823256369b3a1e1fe4",
      "text": "sebagai penutup",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 15,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "86d710482868957e7f21742d8c5b00c9a3be955f955b295cc202500813d06722",
      "text": "laporan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "870cfe73d474393016678a716a99d729e4cb7a652d74a24d1cb4656ba15efbc3",
      "text": "grafik",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8850069b44aab3b3e0b41873abfe5413ed7cabe4682d528642c97c19943642bc",
      "text": "Hadirin yang saya hormati, pertama-tama saya akan menunjukkan sebuah grafik.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8aee24299b70d6966afaf52f092b7c9f886cb34d26f97a7dbc17f36f27009acd",
      "text": "Grafik ini menunjukkan bahwa rata-rata harga beras naik.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8d58b52338be7d860254edb8119cf9ad6e9fd2f4b7849acb6c3a6a4a0a7fdc11",
      "text": "Jadi apa kesimpulanmu?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 22,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "936c15720cdfe886e38c59eaea1b26999e5d141c476086e2d3ff6d147a11bcf6",
      "text": "presentasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "94d6904b51b3b86c8a922a8bd081858630dffe18f70c7af884cb94c2feaba0e0",
      "text": "saran",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "986ee409a44963b31700e29dfc14303099485c6fa64e83bf8248f5b580ab1e68",
      "text": "Betul, \"oleh karena itu\" untuk akibat. Simpan untuk kesimpulan, ya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9dc426f2e5c27a01def1952d816d2d9663544387c11c9212f649d19c70d6847a",
      "text": "Di Singkawang ada vihara, masjid dan gereja yang berdekatan. Warganya hidup rukun.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 82,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b079ebff478e35aa26c41c3633ca17be14e3e0bcaf058dfa5c30b72d6f0bf578",
      "text": "oleh karena itu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 15,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b48e2fcd0a2cd9e74831d5a92200b8bb6e1f79423d261b858a4c863231800bdc",
      "text": "keberagaman",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b56bcbc40f514860536229c9b0de64b3af91eda7ce94283dbd266354671114fd",
      "text": "Dengan demikian, toleransi membuat warga hidup rukun.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bc4329f251b1a2e1b20bd3b353a196cc02fd48419433a84d52a52cc7406d03eb",
      "text": "menyajikan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bd6b2d35f502b7030931a96828d7c097196d6bf99ea3414bea11137f442edfca",
      "text": "penelitian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c2728336826c2d5b2cadb8a6803af2b45682c39598e3e804df5bd5b8dfa9ad75",
      "text": "Bagus! Lalu bagaimana kamu pindah ke bagian kedua?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c3325dd4c16b8ae11019c846e18e142a533236e0ab45f6b653b34d497443a7f5",
      "text": "Mohamed, lihat lampion dan naganya! Semua orang ikut merayakan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c38218914cbd20f1ae3e50649260bdef41c9b51f1d2c45908592e9a2afeec0cc",
      "text": "kunjungan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c74a4a51dc5ad803a92ce1f7a8c38619e0a2db237976d693f7d9065187be75df",
      "text": "Bagus. Bagian tentang keberagaman sangat menarik.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c78ee5fa4705f62aba778bf967023d2e971615c17e3cfef546e0a044ac49c108",
      "text": "Penelitian ini membahas kunjungan wisatawan ke Singkawang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c7e5574f7e0fb303a861bf3c2502f91ed95a94a412ace206cd971534891825d8",
      "text": "toleransi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d62b337dbd54f6148c7dbfd2ad35c058bcbac0516cb2099aac81819dbf852ac8",
      "text": "Pertama-tama, presentasi saya terdiri atas tiga bagian.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d64c54b32a8f9c6eb9b8bc30936b731f1daae5fe6d6ad05759b07b2345e97ecc",
      "text": "Ada tatung Tionghoa dan juga tatung Dayak. Ini data terbaik untuk laporan saya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 79,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "db6253759428896ccc24f9b72c4f6fecc65db268ae6eb1e85516c6b96138a7ee",
      "text": "Sebagai penutup, saya menyarankan festival kecil setiap bulan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "db65d7ab76785658e759fafa0f4fdbd504c7f434f4e7024110e20bb9bdec8380",
      "text": "Pertanyaan Ibu sangat bagus. Saya akan menjawabnya dengan data.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e6617fbc591b19cf6e9823a28dacc245d6f45ac953d79e543cf1fc66a182823d",
      "text": "Rina, lihat grafik saya. Jumlah pengunjung meningkat menjelang Cap Go Meh.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e93dcb73af7b59d0cbc5574a2d0a9089526db1e2eaa95bbd75062d7fe5a696f6",
      "text": "Baik. Pendahuluan, hasil penelitian, kesimpulan, lalu saran, kan?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e9836168c2e96f9f677af3ded704c3ce87dea9c588f804573096b5ea64ffea20",
      "text": "kesimpulan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e9c08d7d3868b235911b10efed5ebd18ebbb117a9c6c38423d56572e6bc3e2f4",
      "text": "Keberagaman bukan masalah. Di sini, keberagaman adalah perayaan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "eed70d29c22d7380d81c0b801aacbb79c153b279c3a378f5bd171d726c435c34",
      "text": "Sebagai penutup, saya ingin mengucapkan terima kasih kepada Mas Rizal.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fa3b6c8776607aa80e7c5d86434b9a9d982bc26ebb825ce49c43b8ba1e4c47e7",
      "text": "Mohamed, tugas terakhir kita adalah laporan tentang Singkawang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
